{"title":"2017 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 8","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>For what integer <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> does <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/8/f/68fa85e4b375011aa47bb4bf5c26c3e6f88bfec4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2 - x + n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"83\" height=\"16\" /> divide into <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/6/4/f644459667ddd1e8dce64e2101c0e26c7c7589b0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^{13} - 233x - 44$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"124\" height=\"15\" /> with no remainder? That is,\nfor what integer <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> is the first polynomial a factor of the second one? As always, justify your\nanswer.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>-1\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_UNCO_Math_Contest_II\" title=\"2017 UNCO Math Contest II\">2017 UNCO Math Contest II</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems\" title=\"2017 UNCO Math Contest II Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Answer_Key\" title=\"2017 UNCO Math Contest II Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://uncmathcontest.wordpress.com/\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2017 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 7\">Problem 7</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2017 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 9\">Problem 9</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2017 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2017 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2017 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2017 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki